  m_Name: Quiz_capillary
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::VRLearning.Data.QuizDefinition
  QuizId: quiz_capillary
  ModuleId: blood_circulation
  Title: Capillaries
  Questions:
  - Question: Capillary walls are only one cell thick to allow...
    Options:
    - Easy gas exchange
    - Faster flow
    - More pressure
    - Storage
    CorrectIndex: 0
    Explanation: Thin walls let oxygen and carbon dioxide pass through easily.
  - Question: Red blood cells pass through capillaries mostly in a...
    Options:
    - Single file
    - Big clump
    - Backward flow
    - Circle
    CorrectIndex: 0
    Explanation: Capillaries are so narrow that cells squeeze through one at a time.
  - Question: At the tissues, capillaries deliver oxygen and collect...
    Options:
    - Carbon dioxide
    - More oxygen
    - Water
    - Light
    CorrectIndex: 0
    Explanation: Cells give off carbon dioxide, which the blood carries away.
  CorrectClip: {fileID: 0}
  WrongClip: {fileID: 0}
  CompleteClip: {fileID: 0}
  PassThreshold: 0.6
